# What to keep OUT of the build context.
# This is not only about speed - it is a security control:
# .env holds the Mongo URI, JWT secret and Cloudinary keys. If it lands in the
# image, anyone who pulls that image has all of them.
# On Kubernetes these values come from a Secret, not from a file.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

node_modules
npm-debug.log*

.git
.gitignore
.github

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
k8s/

.DS_Store
